scoswm (0.5.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Make taskbar and desktop shortcuts independent, with one-time legacy
    migration and preservation of an explicitly empty desktop list. Add
    per-app Launch/Add/Move/Remove menus on launcher, taskbar and desktop.
  * Add persistent nearest-grid desktop dragging, taskbar reordering,
    bidirectional cross-surface drag/drop, snap/insertion previews and a
