scoswm (0.4.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix leaked drag state: a button release now ends any drag wherever
    it lands. Releasing over another window or the taskbar previously
    left windows glued to the pointer, suppressed desktop repaints and
    left ghost frames of closed windows on the desktop.
  * Paint the wallpaper into a root background pixmap so the X server
    restores the desktop instantly when windows close/move (no more
    split-second flicker or leftover window outlines).
  * Discover apps in all XDG data dirs plus Flatpak and Snap export
    directories, and add an "All installed apps..." browse mode to
    the launcher (Esc returns to the core view).

